### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@contentType = application/json

# Admin token - user must have admin role with admin:read scope
@adminToken = {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### ===========================================
### Audit Logs
### ===========================================

### Get all audit logs (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Get audit logs with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit-logs?limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Filter by action type
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit-logs?action=auth.login
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Filter by status (success, failure, blocked)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit-logs?status=failure
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Filter by user ID
# Replace USER_ID with actual user ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit-logs?userId=USER_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Filter by date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit-logs?startDate=2025-12-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2025-12-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Combined filters - failed logins in date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit-logs?action=auth.login&status=failure&startDate=2025-12-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
